{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0287","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:000001b5:text","row":38997,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"学校に行こうと家を出ると、支倉曜子。","en":"When I left for school, Youko Hasekura was standing outside.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903715","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00001","en":"On leaving house to go to school, there's Hasekura Youko.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00000216:text","row":38998,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「おはよう、太一」","en":"“Good morning, Taichi.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903716","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00002","en":"Taichi: \"Morning, Taichi.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["name_address","presentation"],"assessment":"The source is Youko greeting Taichi by name. The English labels Taichi as the speaker, making him address himself.","remedy":"Youko: \"Morning, Taichi.\"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":26,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"Morning, Taichi.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00000248:text","row":38999,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「うん。じゃ、そーいうことでばいばーい」","en":"“Morning. Well, that settles that. Bye-bye.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903717","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00003","en":"Taichi: \"Yep. Well, with that said bai baaai!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00000340:text","row":39000,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"立ち去る。","en":"I walked away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903718","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00004","en":"Leaving.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00000362:text","row":39001,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"背後から裾をつままれる。","en":"She caught the back of my shirt.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903719","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00005","en":"The lower part of my trousers is pinched from behind.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["overinterpretation","word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00000446:text","row":39002,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぐえ……」","en":"“Ghk...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903720","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00006","en":"Taichi: \"G'weh...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:0000048f:text","row":39003,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「ちょ、ちょっとくらい話してくれてもいいのに……」","en":"“Y-you could at least talk to me for a minute...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903721","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00007","en":"Youko: \"Bu-, but we could talk for just a while...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:000004d9:text","row":39004,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"声が震えていた。","en":"Her voice trembled.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903722","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00008","en":"Her voice was shaking.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:0000056a:text","row":39005,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「キミは俺に従属的でありながら、たまに裏をかこうとする」","en":"“You act submissive toward me, but every so often you try to get the better of me.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903723","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00009","en":"Taichi: \"You act all subordinate to me, but still sometimes you try to plot against me.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:000005c2:text","row":39006,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「そんなキミを全面的に信用することはできない」","en":"“I can't trust you completely.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903724","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00010","en":"Taichi: \"And because you're like that I can't go all-out with my trust.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:0000068e:text","row":39007,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「適度な刺激を演出」","en":"“I'm just keeping things exciting.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903725","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00011","en":"Youko: \"Staging an adequate stimulus.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:000006c2:text","row":39008,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺を自分のてのひらで踊らせたいのだろうが、そうはイカ腹幼女」","en":"“You want me wrapped around your little finger, but you can kiss my calamari, squid-bellied pipsqueak.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903726","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00012","en":"Taichi: \"You're just going to make me dance around as you please in the palm of your hand, you little girlie with your squidlike profile.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:0000073d:text","row":39009,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「……島友貴っぽい。ちょっぴり幻滅」","en":"“...That sounded like Tomoki. I'm a little disappointed.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903727","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00013","en":"Youko: \"...so Shima Tomoki-like. Just a bit of disillusionment.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00000779:text","row":39010,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"幻滅された。","en":"I'd disappointed her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903728","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00014","en":"I had been disillusioned.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says Youko became disillusioned with the narrator. The English instead says the narrator himself experienced disillusionment.","remedy":"She was disillusioned with me.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":25,"start":0,"text":"I had been disillusioned."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00000823:text","row":39011,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「いいじゃない。別に。太一、ちょっとサルっぽいし」","en":"“So what? You're kind of an ape yourself.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903729","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00015","en":"Youko: \"That's fine. Not really a problem. You're a bit monkeyish, Taichi.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00000875:text","row":39012,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「馬鹿にしないでもらおう。俺は霊長類だ」","en":"“Don't make fun of me. I'm a primate.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903730","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00016","en":"Taichi: \"Don't make a fool of me, please! I am a primate.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:0000091e:text","row":39013,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903731","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00017","en":"Youko: \"......\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00000942:text","row":39014,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"馬鹿にされてる気がする。","en":"I had the distinct feeling she was making fun of me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903732","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00018","en":"I felt like I had just been ridiculed.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00000972:text","row":39015,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"くそ、反抗的な。","en":"Damn her. Getting rebellious.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903733","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00019","en":"Damn, so defiant.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:0000099a:text","row":39016,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"いじめてやる。","en":"Fine. I'd torment her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903734","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00020","en":"I'll bully her.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:000009c0:text","row":39017,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"スカートをめくった。","en":"I flipped up her skirt.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","gh