e lightly catches or steadies her breath. The English uses an ungrammatical complement and indefinite gerund.","remedy":"she lightly steadied her breathing","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":52,"start":19,"text":"she steadied to a light breathing"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00001273:text","row":39048,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「血中の酸素量が多いと、長く止めていられる」","en":"“The more oxygen in your blood, the longer you can hold your breath.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903764","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00052","en":"Youko: \"High amount of oxygen in the blood, I can stop for a long time.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["omission","mistranslation"],"assessment":"Youko says a high blood-oxygen level lets her hold her breath for a long time. The English omits the object of 'stop,' leaving the physiological ability unstated.","remedy":"I can hold my breath for a long time","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":70,"start":44,"text":"I can stop for a long time"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:000012bf:text","row":39049,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「海人さんか、きみは」","en":"“What are you, a pearl diver?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903765","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00053","en":"Taichi: \"You an ocean floor diver or something, you gotta be.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00001373:text","row":39050,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「なにがしたかったの？」","en":"“What were you trying to do?”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903766","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00054","en":"Youko: \"What did you want to do?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:000013ab:text","row":39051,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"「……口を開けさせようかなって思って」","en":"“...I thought I'd make you open your mouth.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903767","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00055","en":"Taichi: \"...I was thinking how nice it would be if I made you open your mouth.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["addition","register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:0000140e:text","row":39052,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「あーん」","en":"“Aah.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903768","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00056","en":"Youko: \"Ahhhh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00001430:text","row":39053,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"簡単だった。","en":"That was easy.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903769","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00057","en":"That was simple.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:0000145c:text","row":39054,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「ベロ出して」","en":"“Tongue out.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903770","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00058","en":"Taichi: \"Out with the licker.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:000014a7:text","row":39055,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「んー」","en":"“Mmm.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903771","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00059","en":"Youko: \"Nhhh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:000014c7:text","row":39056,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"長いベロ。","en":"What a long tongue.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903772","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00060","en":"A long tongue.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:000014e9:text","row":39057,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"タバスコを振る。十滴くらい。","en":"I shook about ten drops of Tabasco onto it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903773","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00061","en":"I sprinkle tabasco. Around ten drops.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:0000151d:text","row":39058,"ordinal