,"kind":"text","jp":"一瞬平気なのかな、と思ったが。","en":"For a second, I thought even that hadn't worked.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903780","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00068","en":"I thought for an instant she would be alright, but...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:000017a8:text","row":39065,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「……っっ」","en":"“...Nnngh!”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903781","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00069","en":"Youko: \"...!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:00001884:text","row":39066,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"口を押さえて震えだした。","en":"She covered her mouth and started trembling.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903782","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00070","en":"She held down her mouth and shook.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:000018b4:text","row":39067,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"煉瓦の壁によりかかってしまう。","en":"She sagged against the brick wall.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903783","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00071","en":"She goes to lean onto the brick wall.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:000018ea:text","row":39068,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"効いた。","en":"That did it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903784","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00072","en":"That was effective.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0287:0000190a:text","row":39069,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"常人より秀逸な舌を持っているせいで、敏感なのだ。","en":"Her extraordinary tongue made her extra sensitive.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903785","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0003:00073","en":"Because she has a tongue far more excellent than that of a normal person's, she's sensitive.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"c